# Surgical Changes

- Touch only files and lines required for the request.
- Do not refactor unrelated code, comments, formatting, or naming.
- Match existing local style and patterns.
- If unrelated dead code is noticed, mention it; do not remove unless asked.
- Remove only unused code/imports introduced by your own change.
